  lines:
  - id: 0
    category: 0
    variants:
    - There's a device on your body. | Three modules. One timer at a time. When it
      hits zero, it goes off.
    clips: []
    alert: 
    playsOverMenus: 0
  - id: 1
    category: 0
    variants:
    - 'The rules are simple: solve it, disarm it, get out.'
    clips: []
    alert: 
    playsOverMenus: 0
  - id: 2
    category: 0
    variants:
    - You're not alone in the complex anymore. And there's more than time to worry
      about now.
    clips: []
    alert: '> CONTAINMENT BREACH'
    playsOverMenus: 0
  - id: 3
    category: 0
    variants:
    - You made it. You're the first.
    clips: []
    alert: <color=#2EB847>> {0} DISARMED</color>
    playsOverMenus: 1
  - id: 4
    category: 1
    variants:
    - Industrial sector. Three parts of the system to bring back online. Once all
      three are up, you can move on.
    clips: []
    alert: '|| Safe Zone || '
    playsOverMenus: 0
  - id: 5
    category: 1
    variants:
    - Down here you'll have to think a little harder before it goes off.
    clips: []
    alert: 
    playsOverMenus: 0
  - id: 6
    category: 1
    variants:
    - Module disarmed. The gate is open. The complex goes on.
    clips: []
    alert: <color=#2EB847>> M1 DISARMED</color>
    playsOverMenus: 0
  - id: 7
    category: 1
    variants:
    - Two modules down. One left.
    clips: []
    alert: <color=#2EB847>> M2 DISARMED</color>
    playsOverMenus: 0
  - id: 8
    category: 1
    variants:
    - Someone was here before you. They left something for whoever came next.
    clips: []
    alert: 
    playsOverMenus: 0
  - id: 9
    category: 2
    variants:
    - You're running out of time.
    - Almost.
    - Tick Tack, Tick Tack.
    clips: []
    alert: '> {0} CRITICAL'
    playsOverMenus: 0
  - id: 10
    category: 2
    variants:
    - The legs. Every step from now on will remind you.
    clips: []
    alert: '> {0} DETONATED'
    playsOverMenus: 0
  - id: 11
    category: 2
    variants:
    - The chest. Breathing will cost you more than it used to.
    clips: []
    alert: '> {0} DETONATED'
    playsOverMenus: 0
  - id: 12
    category: 2
    variants:
    - The head. What you see won't always be real from now on.
    clips: []
    alert: '> {0} DETONATED'
    playsOverMenus: 0
  - id: 13
    category: 2
    variants:
    - You made it in time.
    - Good.
    clips: []
    alert: 
    playsOverMenus: 0
  - id: 14
    category: 2
    variants:
    - Too close.
    - That was a mistake.
    - You moved when you shouldn't have.
    - Predictable.
    - Obvious from the moment you walked into that room.
    - It doesn't miss.
    - It always gets there.
    - It's been doing this a long time.
    - This has happened before.
    - Plenty made that same call.
    - That's usually how it ends.
    - Curious. Not where I expected.
    - Did you see it coming?
    - This is part of the process.
    - Interesting. Almost.
    clips: []
    alert: 
    playsOverMenus: 0
  - id: 15
    category: 2
    variants:
    - You got this far. That's already more than most.
    clips: []
    alert: 
    playsOverMenus: 1
  - id: 16
    category: 3
    variants:
    - It's close. Very close.
    - It can hear you.
    - Don't move.
    - It already knows you're there.
    - That sound you made was a mistake.
    - It's two rooms away.
    - Don't look at it. It won't help.
    - Still.
    - It doesn't like loud noises.
    - It learns the routes. Change yours.
    - It doesn't tolerate being ignored.
    - If you lose sight of it, it doesn't lose sight of you.
    - It doesn't run. It doesn't need to.
    - You're not the first to stand there.
    - Others got this far. None of them made it past that point.
    - This place has a memory.
    - You're taking longer than expected.
    - Interesting. That wasn't the obvious route.
    - I'm watching you.
    - Notice you're breathing differently? That's normal.
    - The device is working perfectly.
    - That sound you hear is the timer. You'll get used to it.
    - When it goes off, it doesn't hurt right away.
